  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Source and district selection",
      "items": [
        "The collector publishes every source page and its catalog before the feed hook. Only an acknowledged head makes events visible.",
        "The first feed and worker reads are silent. Later events must be less than five minutes old.",
        "For 전남광주통합특별시, resolve Gwangju and Jeonnam by district and skip unmapped districts. Apply the inclusive alert window and deduplicate package/token."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "One-shot delivery",
      "items": [
        "Stop when an endpoint claim is unavailable or already taken. Prepare OAuth before the final guard.",
        "Check the latest registration journal and active warning state before FCM POST. Error, timeout, expiry or release prevents the send.",
        "A lost response never authorizes a resend. The claim survives missing results, cancellation and restart."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Activation boundary",
      "items": [
        "S12 feeds only rows with acknowledged raw and catalog publication.",
        "S20 owns process wiring. Synthetic HTTP acceptance is not device delivery."
      ]
    }
  ]
